Z80 ) HEX                                                     00 00 00 T!                                                     08 07 8 1FAMILY,                                                  RLCA RRCA RLA  RRA  DAA  CPL  SCF  CCF                        \                                                               08 00 2 1FAMILY,   NOP       EXAFAF                             \                                                               08 E3 4 1FAMILY,   EX(SP)HL  EXDEHL  DI  EI                     \                                                               00 00 238 T!                                                    08 00 8 XFAMILY|                                                   00| 08| 10| 18|                                                 20| 28| 30| 38|                                              00 00 238 C7 1PI    RST                                         -->                                                             \ RST 38|  DAA                                                  ( Z80 ) HEX                                                     00 00 07 T!                                                     01 00 8 XFAMILY|                                                  B|  C|    D|  E|                                                H|  L| (HL)|  A|                                              08 80 8 1FAMILY,                                                 ADDA ADCA SUBA SBCA                                             ANDA XORA ORA  CPA                                             \                                                               00 00 00 76 1PI HALT                                            -->                                                             \ ADDA B|                                                       \ HALT                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          ( Z80 ) HEX                                                     00 00 30 T!                                                     10 00 4 XFAMILY|                                                  BC| DE| HL| SP|                                               01 02 2 1FAMILY,                                                  LD(X)A INCX                                                   01 09 3 1FAMILY,                                                  ADDHL  LDA(X)  DECX                                           00 0200 30 01 1PI LDX                                           00 00 30 30 XFI AF|                                             00 00 30 T!                                                     04 C1 2 1FAMILY,                                                  POP PUSH                                                      -->                                                             \ LD(X)A BC|                                                    \ LDX BC| nn NN,                                                ( Z80 immediate data )                                          00 0100 00 T!                                                   08 D3 2 1FAMILY,                                                  OUTA  INA                                                     00 0800 00 T!                                                   08 C6 8 1FAMILY,                                                  ADDN ADCN SUBN SBCN                                             ANDN XORN ORN  CPN                                            00 00 00 T!                                                     10 C9 4 1FAMILY,                                                  RET EXX JPHL LDSPHL                                           -->                                                             \ OUTA n P,   INA n P,                                          \ ADDN n N,                                                                                       