LD()X SP| nn AA,                                              \ IN(C) L'|                                                     \ OUT(C) H'|                                                    ( ED prefix )                                                   00 00 00 T!                                                     01 44 4 EDFAMILY,                                                 NEG RETN IM0 LDIA                                             02 4D 2 EDFAMILY,                                                 RETI LDRA                                                     01 56 2 EDFAMILY,                                                 IM1 LDAI                                                      01 5E 2 EDFAMILY,                                                 IM2 LDAR                                                      08 67 2 EDFAMILY,                                                 RRD RLD                                                       -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( ED prefix )                                                   00 00 00 T!                                                     01 A0 4 EDFAMILY,                                                 LDI  CPI  INI  OUTI                                           01 A8 4 EDFAMILY,                                                 LDD  CPD  IND  OUTD                                           01 B0 4 EDFAMILY,                                                 LDIR CPIR INIR OTIR                                           01 B8 4 EDFAMILY,                                                 LDDR CPDR INDR OTDR                                           -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( CB prefix )                                                   00 00 07 T!                                                     08 00 8 CBFAMILY,                                                 RLC  RRC  RL  RR                                                SLA  SRA  SL1 SRL                                             00 00 43F T!                                                    40 40 3 CBFAMILY,                                                 BIT  RES  SET                                                 00 00 438 T!                                                    08 00 8 XFAMILY|                                                  0| 1| 2| 3| 4| 5| 6| 7|                                       -->                                                             \ RLC B|                                                        \ BIT 3| B|                                                     \ RES 3| B|                                                     \ SET 3| B|                                                     ( IX IY prefix )                                                HEX                                                             00 00 00 T!                                                     02 E3 1 DDFAMILY,                                                 EX(SP)IX                                                      02 E3 1 FDFAMILY,                                                 EX(SP)IY                                                      \                                                               10 E9 2 DDFAMILY,                                                 JPIX  LDSPIX                                                  10 E9 2 FDFAMILY,                                                 JPIY  LDSPIY                                                  \                                                               -->                                                             \                                                                                                                               ( IX IY prefix )                                                HEX                                                             00 00 30 T!                                                     00 09 1 DDFAMILY, ADDIX                                         00 09 1 FDFAMILY, ADDIY                                         \                                                               00 0400 00 T!                                                   \                                                               08 22 2 DDFAMILY,                                                 LD()IX LDIX()                                                 08 22 2 FDFAMILY,                                                 LD()IY  LDIY()                                                -->                                                             \ ADDIX IX|  ADDIX SP|                                          \ LD()IY aa AA,                                                 \ LDIY() aa AA,                                                 ( IX IY prefix )                                                : I)                                                            HERE 1 - C@                                                     HERE 2 - C@ [ HEX ] CB - IF                                     -1 ALLOT SWAP C, C,                                             ELSE                                                            -2 ALLOT SWAP C, CB C, C,                                       THEN ;                                                          TOOLS-ASM                                                       00 00 07 T!                                                     00 06 1 XFAMILY| (I                                             : (IX+  (I  DD I) ;                                             : (IY+  (I  FD I) ;                                             TOOLS-ASM                                                       -->                                                             \ LD B'| (IY+ d )|    ADCA (IY+ d )|   SRA (IY+ d )|            ( IX IY prefix )                                                HEX                                                             : )|                                                              HERE 1 - C@                                                     HERE 2 - C@                                                     CB = IF SWAP THEN                                               HERE 1 - C! C, ;                                              \                                                               : IXY| ( n -- )                                                  DUP HERE 2 - C@ - IF                                             HERE 1- C@                                                      -1 ALLOT SWAP C, C,                                            THEN ;                                                         TOOLS-ASM                                                       -->                                                                                                                             ( IX IY prefix )                                                \ INC DEC  (IX'+ d )|                                           \ LDN  (IX'+ d )|  n N,                                         00 00 38 T!                                                     00 30 1 XFAMILY|   (I'                                          : (IX'+ (I' DD I) ;                                             : (IY'+ (I' FD I) ;                                             TOOLS-ASM                                                       \ LD(IX+ d )|  r|                                               00 00 07 T!                                                     00 70 1 DDFAMILY, LD(IX+                                        00 70 1 FDFAMILY, LD(IY+                                        : )'| ' EXECUTE )| ;                                            TOOLS-ASM                                                       -->                                                                                                                             ( IX IY prefix )                                                \ LDIXL A|                                                      00 00 07 T!                                                     08 60 2                                                            DDFAMILY, LDIXH LDIXL                                        08 60 2                                                            FDFAMILY, LDIYH LDIYL                                        -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( IX IY prefix )                                                HEX                                                             : IX| HL| DD IXY| ;                                             : IY| HL| FD IXY| ;                                             : IXL| L| DD IXY| ;                                             : IXH| H| DD IXY| ;                                             : IYL| L| FD IXY| ;                                             : IYH| H| FD IXY| ;                                             TOOLS-ASM                                                       \ LDX IY| nn NN,                                                \ POP IY|  LD A'| IXL|                                          \ DP @ U. KEY \ verify...                                       \                                                               DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                         ( Page-in and Page-out - development )                          HEX                                                             ' LIT <NAME CONSTANT PAGE-ORG                                   \                                                               : PAGE-IN                                                         PAGE-ORG 0< NOT IF                                                DP @ LP ! E080 DP !                                           THEN ;                                                        \                                                               : PAGE-OUT                                                        PAGE-ORG 0< NOT IF                                                DP @ LP @ DP ! LP !                                           THEN ;                                                        \                                                                                                                                                                                               .( Z80 near structure )   CR                                    ASSEMBLER DEFINITIONS HEX                                       : NEXT                     JPIX ;                               : PSH1           PUSH HL|  JPIX ;                               : PSH2 PUSH DE|  PUSH HL|  JPIX ;                               \ : ldsp,rp ldx() sp| 30 +origin AA, ;                          \ : ldrp,sp ld()x sp| 30 +origin AA, ;                          \ : ldhl,rp ldx() hl| 30 +origin AA, ;                          \ : ldrp,hl ld()x hl| 30 +origin AA, ;                          : HOLDPLACE HERE 0 D, ;                                         : DISP, OVER -                                                    1 - SWAP C! ;                                                 : BACK,                                                          HOLDPLACE SWAP DISP, ;                                         \                                                               : | ;  -->                                                      ( Z80 Near struct. )                                            : THEN, HERE DISP, ;                                            : ELSE, JR HOLDPLACE                                              SWAP THEN, ;                                                  \                                                               DECIMAL                                                         EXIT                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ( Z80 Near struct. )                                            EXIT                                                            \                                                               : IF, JRF Z'|                                                     HOLDPLACE ;                                                   : -IF, JRF NZ'|                                                   HOLDPLACE ;                                                   : <IF, JRF CY'|                                                   HOLDPLACE ;                                                   : -<IF, JRF NC'|                                                  HOLDPLACE ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ( Z80 Near struct. )                                            EXIT                                                            : BEGIN, HERE ;                                                 : UNTIL, IF, SWAP DISP, ;                                       : -UNTIL, -IF, SWAP DISP, ;                                     : <UNTIL, <IF, SWAP DISP, ;                                     : -<UNTIL, -<IF, SWAP DISP, ;                                   : WHILE, IF, ;                                                  : -WHILE, -IF, ;                                                : <WHILE, <IF, ;                                                : -<WHILE, -<IF, ;                                              : REPEAT, JR HOLDPLACE                                            ROT DISP, THEN, ;                                             -->                                                                                                                                                                                             ( Z80 Near struct. )                                            EXIT                                                            : DJNZ,                                                           DJNZ HOLDPLACE                                                  SWAP DISP, ;                                                  FORTH DEFINITIONS                                               DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ." Z80 far struct "                                             : THEN' HERE SWAP ! ;                                           : HOLDPLACE' HERE 0 AA, ;                                       : IF' JPF Z| HOLDPLACE' ;                                       : ELSE' JP HOLDPLACE                                                    SWAP THEN' ;                                            : BEGIN' HERE ;                                                 : UNTIL' IF' DROP THEN' ;                                       : WHILE' IF' ;                                                  : REPEAT' ELSE' DROP THEN' ;                                    DECIMAL                                                         FORTH DEFINITIONS                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               ( Testing & Debugging this vocabulary )                         : T?                                                             TALLY-BY ?                                                      TALLY-BI ?                                                      TALLY-BA ?                                                     ;                                                               : H?                                                             HEX                                                             HERE 8 - DUMP                                                  ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               ( 128K memory BANK! test )                                      \ This is a 48 legacy example incompatibile with this           \ system because it banks BANK at $C000                         HEX                                                             \ BANKM : 5B5C                                                  : ?BANK BASE @                                                    5B5C C@ 2 BASE ! .                                              BASE ! ;                                                      : TEST                                                            BANK!                                                           C000 @ U.                                                       10 BANK!                                                      ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               ( 128K memory BANK! test )                                      \ n  between 0 and 7                                            \ set bank n at C000                                            CODE BANK! ( n -- )                                              LDAR                                                            DI                                                              EXAFAF                                                          LD   D'|   B|                                                   LD   E'|   C|                                                   POP  BC|                                                        LDX  HL|  HEX  5B5C NN,                                         LD   A'| (HL)|                                                  ANDN HEX  F8  N,                                                ORA   C|                                                        LDX  BC|  HEX  7FFD NN,                                        -->                                                             ( 128K memory BANK! test )                                       OUT(C) A'|                                                      LD  (HL)'|   A|                                                 LD     B'|   D|                                                 LD     C'|   E|                                                 EXAFAF                                                          JPF    PO|  HERE 3 + AA,                                        EI                                                              NEXT                                                           C;                                                              \                                                               HEX                                                             : BANK@                                                          5B5C @ 7 AND                                                   ;                                                                                                                               ( Assembler test - 0 )                                          CODE TEST0                                                       RLCA RRCA RLA RRA                                               DAA CPL SCF CCF                                                 NOP EXAFAF EX(SP)HL EXDEHL                                      DI EI HALT RET EXX                                              JPHL LDSPHL                                                     RST 00| RST 38|                                                 ADDA B| ADCA C| SUBA D|                                         SBCA E| ANDA H| XORA L|                                         ORA (HL)| CPA A|                                                LD(X)A BC| LDA(X) DE|                                           INCX HL| DECX SP|                                               ADDHL BC| ADDHL SP|                                            C;                                                              -->                                                             ( Assembler test - 1 )                                          CODE TEST1                                                       LDX  BC| 1234 NN,                                               LDX  SP| 5678 NN,                                               PUSH AF| POP HL|                                                OUTA 254 P, INA 254 P,                                          ADDN 1 N, ADCN 2 N,                                             SUBN 3 N, SBCN 4 N,                                             ANDN 5 N, XORN 6 N,                                             ORN  7 N, CPN  8 N,                                             LD()HL 1234 AA,                                                 LDHL() 1234 AA,                                                 LD()A  1234 AA,                                                 LDA()  1234 AA,                                                C;                                                              -->                                                             ( Assembler test - 2 )                                          CODE TEST2                                                       JP 1234 AA, CALL 1234 AA,                                       INC B'| DEC A'|                                                 LD D'| E|  LD (HL)'| A|                                         LDN B'| 1 N, LDN A'| 8 N,                                       JPF Z| 1234 AA,                                                 CALLF M| 1234 AA,                                               RETF PE|                                                        DJNZ -10 D, JR +10 D,                                           JRF NZ'| +10 D,                                                 JRF CY'| -10 D,                                                 SBCHL DE| ADCHL SP|                                             LDX() BC| 1234 AA,                                              LD()X SP| 1234 AA,                                             C; -->                                                          ( Assembler test - 3 )                                          CODE TEST3                                                       IN(C) D'|  OUT(C) E'|                                           NEG RETN IM0 LDIA RETI LDRA                                     IM1 LDAI IM2 LDAR RRD RLD                                       LDI   CPI   INI   OUTI                                          LDD   CPD   IND   OUTD                                          LDIR  CPIR  INIR  OTIR                                          LDDR  CPDR  INDR  OTDR                                          RLC B| RRC C| RL D| RR E|                                       SLA H| SRA L| SRL (HL)|                                         BIT 2| D|  BIT 3| E|                                            RES 4| H|  RES 5| L|                                            SET 6| (HL)| SET 7| A|                                         C;                                                              EXIT                                                            ( Assembler test - 4 )                                          CODE TEST4                                                      BEGIN,                                                          NOP NOP NOP                                                     END,                                                            NEXT                                                            C;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ( Assembler test - 5 )                                          CODE TEST5                                                      INCX IX|  DECX IY|                                              PUSH IX|  POP  IY|                                              EX(SP)IX  JPIY                                                  LDSPIX    LDSPIY                                                ADDIX BC| ADDIX DE|                                             ADDIX IX| ADDIX SP|                                             ADDIY BC| ADDIY DE|                                             ADDIY IY| ADDIY SP|                                             LD()IX 4 AA, LDIX() 3 AA,                                       LD()IY 5 AA, LDIY() 6 AA,                                       LDX IX| 7 NN,                                                   LDX IY| 8 NN,                                                   C;                                                                                                                              ( Assembler test - 6 )                                          CODE TEST6                                                       ADCA (HL)|                                                      ADCA (IY+ 9 )|                                                  INC (HL)'|                                                      INC (IY'+ 9 )|                                                  LDN (HL)'|      5 N,                                            LDN (IY'+ 9 )|  5 N,                                            SRA  (HL)|                                                      SRA (IY+  9 )|                                                  SET 0| (HL)|                                                    SET 0| (IY+ 9 )|                                                LDIX() 1234 AA,                                                C;                                                              EXIT                                                                                                                            ( Assembler test - 7 )                                          CODE TEST7                                                          LDX HL| 0 NN,                                                   BIT 5| (IY+ 1 )|                                                IF, INC L'| THEN,                                           PSH1 C;                                                         \                                                               : KEYIN                                                           BEGIN                                                           TEST7                                                           ?ESCAPE                                                         UNTIL ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ( Assembler test - 8 - Z80N )                                   HEX CODE TEST8                                                   TESTN FF N,                                                     SWAPNIB MIRRORA                                                 LDIX LDDX LDIRX LDDRX                                           LDWS LDPIRX                                                     OUTINB JP(C)                                                    PIXELDN PIXELAD SETAE                                           BSLADE,B BSRADE,B BSRLDE,B                                      BSRFDE,B BRLCDE,B                                               MUL                                                             ADDHL,A ADDDE,A ADDBC,A                                         ADDBC, 07654 NN,                                                PUSHN 07654 LH,  NEXT C;                                                                                                                                                                       ( Assembler test - 9 - Z80N )                                   HEX CODE TEST9                                                   DECIMAL                                                         NEXTREG  3 P, 4 N,                                              NEXTREGA 3 P,                                                   NEXTREG 87 P, 1 N,                                              NEXTREGA 87 P,                                                 NEXT C;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         .( Z80N Next extensions )                                       ASSEMBLER DEFINITIONS HEX                                       : FLIP, FLIP , ;            \ faster than $100 /MOD C, C,       TOOLS-ASM                                                       0 1 0 4000 ' FLIP, COMMAER LH,                                  \                                                               00 0900 00 91 EDPI NEXTREG                                      \  NEXTREG  reg P, n N,                                         00 0100 00 92 EDPI NEXTREGA                                     \  NEXTREGA reg P,                                              00 4000 00 8A EDPI PUSHN                                        \   PUSHN nn LH,                                                00 0800 00 27 EDPI TESTN                                        \  TESTN n N,                                                   -->                                                                                                                             ( Z80N Next extension )                                         \                                                               00 00 00 T!                                                     01 23 2 EDFAMILY,                                                SWAPNIB MIRRORA                                                08 A4 4 EDFAMILY,                                                LDIX LDDX LDIRX LDDRX                                          \                                                               12 A5 2 EDFAMILY,                                                LDWS LDPIRX                                                    08 90 2 EDFAMILY,                                                OUTINB JP(C)                                                   01 93 3 EDFAMILY,                                                PIXELDN PIXELAD SETAE                                          -->                                                                                                                             ( Z80N Next extension )                                         01 28 5 EDFAMILY,                                                BSLADE,B BSRADE,B BSRLDE,B                                      BSRFDE,B BRLCDE,B                                              01 30 4 EDFAMILY,                                                MUL                                                             ADDHL,A ADDDE,A ADDBC,A                                        00 0200 00 T!                                                   01 34 3 EDFAMILY,                                                ADDHL, ADDDE, ADDBC,                                           \ ADDBC, nn NN,                                                 \                                                               FORTH DEFINITIONS DECIMAL                                       \                                                                       \ DP @ LP @ DP !  LP !                                  \                                                               ( ROLL development )                                            NEEDS ASSEMBLER                                                 CODE ROLL ( n1 n2 n3 .. n -- n2 n3 .. n1 )                        exx                         \ we need all registers free        pop     hl|                 \ number of cells to roll           ld      a'|     h|                                              ora      l|                                                     jrf     z'|  HOLDPLACE      \ skip if n is ZERO                 addhl   hl|                 \ number of bytes to move           ld      b'|     h|                                              ld      c'|     l|                                              addhl   sp|                 \ address of n1                     ld      a'|  (hl)|          \ take n1 into de                   incx    hl|                                                     exafaf                                                          ld      a'|  (hl)|          -->                               ( ROLL development )                                              ld      d'|       h|        \ prepare destination address       ld      e'|       l|                                            decx    hl|                                                     decx    hl|                                                     lddr                        \ move 2*n bytes                    exdehl                                                          ld   (hl)'|       a|                                            decx    hl|                                                     exafaf                                                          ld   (hl)'|       a|                                          HERE DISP,                                                        exx                                                             jpix                        \ next address                    C;                                                                                                                              ( M*/ - development )                                           NEEDS PICK                    \ Pick is already in the core     \ mixed scaling: multiply d by a signed fraction n/m            : M*/ ( d  n  m  -- d2 )                                          2dup xor 3 pick xor >R      \ l h n m        R: sign            abs >R abs >R DABS          \ l h            R: sign m n        swap R@ um* rot R> um*      \ l L h H        R: sign m          rot 0 D+                    \ l dx                              R@ um/mod                   \ l r1 q1                           rot rot                     \ q1 l r1                           R> um/mod                   \ q1 r2 q2       R: s               nip swap                    \ q2 q1                             R> D+-                      \ d              R:               ;                                                                                                                                                                                               ( Assembler example - White noise Egghead 3 )                   NEEDS ASSEMBLER DECIMAL                                         CODE WHITE-NOISE  ( -- )                                             di exx               \ preserve registers                  HERE call 0000 AA,                                                   exx ei  NEXT                                               \ subroutine                                                    HERE SWAP 1+ !            \ patch CALL 0000 here above               ldn  e'|  250  N,                                               ldx  hl|  300 NN,    \ start pointer in ROM                HERE push de|                                                        ldn  b'|   32  N,                                          HERE push bc|             \ main loop                                ld   a'| (hl)|                                                  incx hl|                                                   -->                                                             ( Assembler example - White noise Egghead 3 )                        andn 248 N,         \ black border                              outa 254 P,         \ send to speaker                           ld   a'|   e|                                                   cpl                                                        HERE dec  a'|                                                        jrf nz'| BACK,      \ inner delay                               pop  bc|                                                        djnz     BACK,      \ next step to main loop                    pop  de|                                                        ld   a'|    e|                                                  subn 24 N,          \ size of step                              cpn  30 N,          \ end range                                 retf  z|                                                     