                                                                                                                              ( map - character replacing )                                   : t                                                               >r cod  count  dom  count rot min                               r@ . r@ emit space r> (map) dup . emit cr ;                   \                                                                char \ t                                                        char / t                                                        char : t                                                        char | t                                                        char " t                                                        char < t                                                        char > t                                                        char ? t                                                        char * t                                                                                                                                                                                       ( GREY-SCREEN example )                                         HERE                                                             LD   A'|  (HL)|                                                 XORA  D|                                                        LD (HL)'|    A|                                                 INCX HL|                                                        DJNZ BACK,                                                      DEC  C'|                                                        JRF NZ'| BACK,                                                  POP BC|                                                        NEXT C;                                                         DECIMAL                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           