MMU7@ ( -- n )                                                  87 REG@                                                       ;                                                                                                                                                                                               ( Study: MMU7 / simplest )                                      \ decode bits 765 of H as 8K-page 64-71                         \ lower bits of H and L are offset from E000h                   \ heap pointer:                pppb bbbb  bbbb bbbb             \ page:offset:     0100 0ppp : 111b bbbb  bbbb bbbb             \                                                               CODE >FAR ( ha -- a n )                                          pop   hl|                                                      \                                                                ld    a'|  h|                                                   exafaf             \ save h in a'                               ld    a'|  h|                                                   orN   $E0 N,       \ hl is between E000 and FFFF                ld    h'|  a|                                                   exafaf                                                          -->                                                            ( Study: MMU7 / simplest )                                      \                                                                rlca                                                            rlca                                                            rlca                                                            andN  $07 N,                                                    addN  $20 N,                                                   \                                                                push  hl|                                                       ld    l'|  a|                                                   ldN   h'|  00 N,                                                push  hl|                                                       Next                                                           C;                                                              -->                                                                                                                             ( Study: MMU7 / simplest )                                      \ reverse of >FAR: encodes a FAR address 8K-page in bits 765    \ of H, lower bits of HL are offset at E000h                    \                                                               CODE <FAR ( a n -- ha )                                          pop   hl|                                                       ld    a'|  l|                                                   andN  $07 N,    \ page number is betwen 0 and 7                 rrca                                                            rrca                                                            rrca                                                            exafaf                                                          pop   hl|                                                       ld    a'|  h|                                                   -->                                                                                                                            ( Study: MMU7 / simplest )                                      \                                                                andN  $1F N,                                                    ld    h'|  a|                                                   exafaf                                                          orA    h|                                                       ld    h'|  a|                                                   push  hl|                                                       Next                                                           C;                                