              -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( Study: MMU7 / 16th byte )                                     \ reverse of >>FAR, encodes 8K-page in bits 7-1 of H            \ bit 1 of H and L are the address rounded at 16 byte           \                                                               CODE <<FAR ( a2 b -- a1 )                                        pop   hl|          \ page 72-199                                ld    a'|   l|                                                  SUBN  HEX  48  N,                                               exafaf                                                          pop   hl|                                                       ADDHL HL|                                                       ADDHL HL|                                                       ADDHL HL|                                                       ADDHL HL|                                                       -->                                                                                                                            ( Study: MMU7 / 16th byte )                                     \                                                                exafaf                                                          RLA                     \ A receives HL msb                     LD    L'|   H|                                                  LD    H'|   A|                                                  PUSH  HL|                                                       NEXT C;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ( example < asm )                                               code < ( n1 n2 -- f )                                             pop de|      pop hl|                                            ld  a'|  h|  xorn hex 80 n,  ld h'| a|                          ld  a'|  d|  xorn hex 80 n,  ld d'| a|                        \ anda a|                                                         sbchl de|                                                       sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     ( LED - Large EDitor  1/18 )                                    \ Large file EDitor: each line can be 85 characters long        \ then maximum line number is 17.568                            decimal  marker TASK                                             85 CONSTANT COLS/ROW            \ columns per row                8 1024 * COLS/ROW / CONSTANT ROWS/PAGE   \ rows per 8K               512 COLS/ROW / CONSTANT LED-CHARSIZE                     1  VARIABLE LED-LN