al buffer  \ np a a             dup b/buf 2- led-fh @ f_getline >R         \ np a     \ b       swap led-rad COLS/ROW 2dup blank           \ a a1 n1            cmove R>                                   \ b                ;                                                               -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( LED - Large EDitor  4/18 )                                    \ load filename specified in LED-FH                             \ Filehandle must be already open for read                      DECIMAL                                                         : LED-LOAD                                                        begin                                                             led-ln @  show-progress                                         1 led-ln +!                                                     led-ln @ led-rd1                                                ?terminal 1 AND 1- AND                                        0= until \ end of file                                          led-ln @ 1- led-max !                                         ;                                                               -->                                                                                                                                                                                             ( LED - Large EDitor  5/18 )                                    \ accept text for filename and keep it in LED-FN cz-string      decimal                                                         : LED-FILE ( -- cccc )                                            bl word dup 1+ c@ if                                              led-fn 80 erase                                                 led-fn over c@ 1+ cmove 1                                     else drop 0 then                                              ;                                                               : LED-OPEN    \ open file and load to RAM                         led-file if                                                       led-fn 1+ pad 1 f_open 43 ?error led-fh !                       0 led-ln !  led-load led-close                                then                                                          ;                                                               -->                                                             ( LED - Large EDitor  6/18 )                                    \ write line # np to file                                       \ n.b. trailing spaces are always removed                       : LED-WR1  ( np -- )                                              led-rad COLS/ROW -TRAILING                      \ a n           2DUP  + [ HEX ] 0A  SWAP C!                     \ a n           2DUP 1+ LED-FH @ F_WRITE [ decimal ] 47 ?ERROR  \ a n n         DROP  + [ HEX ] 20  SWAP C!                     \             ;                                                               -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( LED - Large EDitor  7/18 )                                    \ save current filename                                         : LED-SAVE                                                        led-fn 1+ pad [ hex 0C 02 + ] LITERAL                           f_open [ decimal ] 43 ?error                                    led-fh  !                                                       LED-MAX @ 1+ 1 ?DO                                                I show-progress                                                 I LED-WR1                                                       ?terminal if leave then \ can be interrupted via BREAK        LOOP                                                            led-fh @ f_close                                                0 led-fh !                                                    ;                                                               -->                                                                                                                             ( LED - Large EDitor  8/18 )                                    DECIMAL                                                         : LED-LINE ( n -- a )     \ address of current screen line n      LED-HOME @ + LED-RAD ;                                        : LED-PAD ( -- a )          \ dedicated PAD                       HERE 168 + ;                                                  : LED-DISPLAY               \ display current screen              16 0 DO                                                           I LED-HOME @ +  LED-MAX @ > IF                                    COLS/ROW 1 do [char] # emit loop                              ELSE                                                              I led-line COLS/ROW TYPE                                      THEN                                                            CR                                                            LOOP                                                          ; -->                                                           ( LED - Large EDitor  9/18 )                                    : LED-MOVE ( a n -- )      \ move from a to line n                led-line COLS/ROW cmove ;                                     : H ( n -- )               \ hold line to pad                     led-line pad 1+ cols/row dup pad c! cmove ;                   : E ( n -- )               \ erase line                           led-line cols/row blank  ;                                    : RE ( n -- )              \ restore line from pad                pad 1+ swap led-move ;                                        : D ( n -- )               \ delete line                          dup H led-max @ dup 1- rot     \  m m-1 n                       ?Do                                                               i 1+ led-line led-pad cols/row cmove                            led-pad i led-move                                            Loop E  -1 led-max +! ;                                       -->                                                             ( LED - Large EDitor 10/18 )                                    : S ( n -- )                \ insert blank line                   dup 1- led-max @          \ n n m                               ?do                                                               i       led-line led-pad cols/row cmove                         led-pad i 1+ led-move                                         -1 +Loop 1 led-max +!                                           E                                                             ;                                                               : INS ( n -- )              \ insert line from pad                dup S RE ;                                                    -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( LED - Large EDitor 11/18 )                                    DECIMAL   0 VARIABLE NROW     NROW !    \ current row                     0 VARIABLE NCOL     NCOL !    \ current columns       : HOMEC   0 NROW ! 0 NCOL ! ;     