              ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ( +loop standardization )                                       NEEDS ASSEMBLER \ Import vocabulary                             \                                                               CODE (-loop)                                                      ldx     hl|   2 NN,                                             addhl   sp|       \ save sp in hl'                              exx                                                             pop     bc|       \ increment                                   ldsp,rp           \ use SP as RP temporarily                    pop     hl|       \ index                                       pop     de|       \ limit                                       push    de|       \ restore it back, interrupt may occur        -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           ( +loop standardization )                                         xora     a|                                                     sbchl   de|     \ index - limit: limit is the new zero          addhl   bc|     \ index - limit + increment                     bit      7|   b|                                                jrf     z'| HOLDPLACE       \ increment < 0 ?                     ccf                                                           HERE DISP,                                                      jrf    cy'| HOLDPLACE                                             addhl   de|   \ index + increment                               push    hl|                                                     exx                                                             ldsphl        \ restore SP and go BRANCH                        jp  ' BRANCH aa,                                            -->                                                                                                                             ( +loop standardization )                                         HERE  DISP,                                                     pop     hl|       \ discard limit                               ldrp,sp           \ change RP                                   exx                                                             ldsphl                                                          incx    bc|       \ skip BRANCH                                 incx    bc|                                                     jpix                                                          c;                                                              -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( +loop standardization )                                       CODE (*LOOP)                                                      ldx     hl|  1  NN,                                             push    hl|                                                     jp      ' (-LOOP)   ( >BODY direct )  AA,                     c;                                                                                                                                                                                                                