              x [compile] +loop                                               x begin                                                             sp@ lp @ -                                                    while                                                             [compile] then                                                repeat                                                          lp !                                                          ; immediate                                                     -->                                                             ( LEAVE study )                                                 needs assembler                                                 code (leave)                                                      ldhl()   hex 30 +origin AA,                                     ldx      de|  4  NN,                                            addhl    de|                                                    ld()hl   hex 30 +origin AA,                                     jp ' BRANCH ( >BODY ) AA,                                       c;                                                            -->                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             ( UNLOOP study )                                                needs unloop                                                    : leave                                                           compile (leave)     \ unloop compile branch                     here >R 0 ,                                                     0 0                 \ csp h 0 h 3 h 2 x x                       sp@ dup cell+ cell+ \               ^   ^ sp sp+4               tuck                \                     sp+4 sp sp+4          csp @ swap -        \                     sp+4 sp csp-sp+4      cmove               \ csp - - h 0 h 3 h 2                       csp @ cell-         \ csp - - h 0 h 3 h 2 csp-2                 R>   over !         \ csp h - h 0 h 3 h 2 csp-2                 cell- 0 swap !      \ csp h 0 h 0 h 3 h 2 csp-2               ; immediate                                                     -->                                                                                                                             ( t )                                                           : t                                                               4 0 ?do                                                           i .                                                             i  if  leave  then                                              i .                                                           loop                                                          ;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               ( Matt Davies'  .helloworld )                                   CODE .helloworld                                                        ldx  hl|   here  0  NN,                                   here  ld   a'|   (hl)|                                                anda  a|                                                        retf  z|                                                        rst  10|                                                        incx hl|                                                        jr   BACK,                                                      c;                                                        here  ," Hello, World!"  1+ swap !                            \                                                               \                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ( Speed Test - Benchmark - 5.12 sec. )                          HEX 5C78 1+ CONSTANT FRAMES DECIMAL  \ system variable          : WAIT-TICK     (   --   )  \ waits for next frame/256            FRAMES C@ BEGIN DUP FRAMES C@  - UNTIL DROP ;                 : DUMMY 100 255 113 */  DROP ;                                  : SPEED-TEST                                                      0  ( init counter )                                             WAIT-TICK ( and take ) FRAMES C@                                BEGIN                                                             SWAP 1+ SWAP  ( increment counter ) \ cnt frame                 DUMMY DUP FRAMES C@ -                                         UNTIL                                                           DROP ;                                                        \ Result  7516 with Indirect Thread                             \ Result  8745 with Direct Thread                               \ Result  9773 with Golden Ratio                                ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               ( F_STAT     via RST 8 hook code )                              \ Get file information/status                                   code F_STAT ( fspec buff -- f )                                   exx                                                             pop   de|      \ 11-byte buffer                                 exx                                                             ex(sp)ix       \ filespec nul-terminated                        push  de|         push  bc|                                     ldn   a'|   char  *  n,    di                                   rst   08|   hex  AC  c,    ei                                   pop   bc|         pop   de|         pop   bc|                   sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix                                                          c;                                                                                                                              ( F_FGETPOS  via RST 8 hook code )                              code F_FGETPOS ( n -- d f ) \ Get current file position.          pop   hl|          ld    a'|   l|                               push  ix|          push  de|          push  bc|                 di                                                              rst  08|   hex  9F  c,                                          ei                                                              exx                                                             pop   bc|          pop   de|          pop   ix|                 exx                                                             push  de|          push  bc|                                    sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix    c;  -->                                                                                                                                                                               ( F_SEEK     via RST 8 hook code )                              code F_SEEK ( d n -- f ) \ Sek to position in file.               exx                                                             pop   hl|          ld    a'|  l|                                pop   bc|          pop   de|                                    exx                                                             push  ix|          push  de|          push  bc|                 exx                                                             ldx   ix| 0 nn,                                                 di                                                              rst   08| $9F  c,                                               ei                                                              pop   bc|          pop   de|          pop   ix|                 sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix    c;  -->                                               ( F_WRITE    via RST 8 hook code )                              code F_WRITE ( a b fh -- n f ) \ Write bytes to file              exx                                                             pop   hl|     \ file handle number                              ld    a'|   l|                                                  pop   bc|     \ bytes to read                                   ex(sp)ix          exx                                           push  de|         push  bc|         di                          rst   08|   hex  9E  c,             ei                          exx                                                             pop   bc|         pop   de|         pop   ix|                   push  de|     \ actual bytes read                               exx               push  de|                                     sbchl hl|     \ flag                                            push  hl|                                                       jpix    c;  -->                                               ( F_READ     via RST 8 hook code )                              code F_READ ( a b fh -- n f ) \ Read bytes from file.             exx                                                             pop   hl|         ld    a'|  l|                                 pop   bc|         ex(sp)ix                                      exx                                                             push  de|         push  bc|                                     di                                                              rst   08|   hex  9D  c,                                         ei                                                              pop   bc|         pop   de|           pop  ix|                  push  de|                                                       sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix    c;  -->                                                                                                               ( F_CLOSE    via RST 8 hook code )                              code F_CLOSE ( fh -- f ) \ Close a file or directory.             pop   hl|       