                                exx                                                             pop   bc|         pop   de|         pop   ix|                   exx                                                             sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix                                                          c;                                                              -->                                                             \ CREATE FILENAME ," file.txt"                                  \ FILENAME 1+ PAD 1 F_OPEN                                      \ DROP                                                          \ F_CLOSE                                                                                                                                                                                       ( F_FSTAT    via RST 8 hook code )                              \ Get file information/status                                   code F_FSTAT ( fspec buf c -- f )                                 exx                                                             pop   hl|         pop   de|        ld   a'|  l|                 exx                                                             ex(sp)ix        \ filespec                                      push  de|         push  bc|                                     di                                                              rst   08|   $AC  c,                                             pop   bc|         pop   de|        pop   ix|                    sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix                                                          c;                                                                                                                              ( F_SYNC     via RST 8 hook code )                              code F_SYNC  ( fh -- f ) \ Sync file changes to disk.             pop   hl|        ld    a'|   l|                                 push  ix|        push  de|          push  bc|                   di                                                              rst   08|   hex  9C  c,                                         ei                                                              pop   bc|        pop   de|          pop   ix|                   sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix                                                          c;                                                              -->                                                             \ 2 F_SYNC works                                                ␀                                                                                                                               ( M_DOSVERSION via RST 8 hook code )                            \ Get API version/mode information                              \ Entry: none                                                   \ Exit: Fc=1, error; A=14 "no such device"                      \ Fc=0, success. BC="NX"; DE=maj.min in BCD format              \   HL="en" or "es" for English/Spanish                         code M_DOSVERSION ( -- n )                                        push  ix|                                                       push  bc|                                                       rst   08|   hex  88  c,                                         pop   bc|                                                       pop   ix|                                                       push  de|                                                       jpix                                                          c;                                                              DECIMAL                                                         ( F_GETFREE  via RST 8 hook code test )                         code f_getfree ( drive -- d ) \ Get free space on drive.          pop   hl|                                                       push  ix|         push  de|          push  bc|                  ld    a'|   l|                                                  di                                                              rst   08|   hex  B1  c,                                         ei                                                              exx                                                             pop   bc|         pop   de|          pop   ix|                  exx                                                             push  de|         push  bc|          exx                        sbchl hl|                                                       push  hl|                                                       jpix                                                          c;                                                              ( M_P3DOS )                                                     code M_P3DOS  \ Make a +3DOS/IDEDOS/NextZXOS API call.             ( n1 n2 n3 n4 a -- n5 n6 n7 n8 )                                ( hl de bc  a   -- hl de bc  a flag )                          exx                                                             pop   hl|   \ call ID                                           pop   de|                                                       ld    a'|    e|                                                 pop   bc|                                                       pop   de|                                                       ex(sp)hl    \ call ID on TOS                                    exx                                                             pop   hl|                                                       push  ix|         push  de|         push  bc|                   exdehl      \ call ID                                         -->               