                                    ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ( LOADG )                                                       *** Warning *** This doesn't work in .dot version yet.                                                                          Rob Probin inspired this example of "development automation"    that exploits the following screens. To enable, you have to     type 3020 LOAD that modifies AUTOEXEC to load Screen #3020      instead of the usual Screen #11 at next start from Basic.       You have to EDIT Screen #3021 to put the INCLUDE you're         developing. The usual course  BYE -- .SYNC -- RUN will do       the whole route again.                                          vForth has no "conditional loading" (such as [IF] but this      example peforms a differend LOAD based on some previous         result.                                                         In this case, if EMPTYDEV marker is found, then Screen          #3025 is LOADed, else Screen #3022 is LOADed.                                                                                   ( LOADG )                                                       \ Example                                                       \  search for EMPTYDEV marker                                     -find EMPTYDEV         \  ff  |  xt b tf                        1 and 3 *              \   0  |  xt b 4                                                                                       \  selectively load Screen 3025 if EMPTYDEV exists              \           or load Screen 3022 if EMPTYDEV doesn't exist         3022 +                                                          dup ." loading " .                                              load                                                                                                                          \ continue to next Screen.                                        -->                                                                                                                                                                                           ( LOADG )                                                       \                                                               \ Put your project main source after Marker                     \                                                                 marker EMPTYDEV                                                 include demo/fedora.f                                         \                                                               \ Done.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         ( LOADG )                                                       \ Check the current dictionary status                           \ to decide if the patch is needed                                ' abort >body  #13 cells + @                                    ' noop = 1 and              \  0  |  1                          ' autoexec >body 3 cells + @                                    ' noop = 1 and and          \  0  |  1                          ' autoexec >body 1 cells + @                                      #11  = 1 and and          \  0  |  1                                                                                        \ call screen# 3023 or #3024                                      3023 + LOAD                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   ( LOADG )                                                       ." no needs for patch" cr                                       \  Keep this screen empty                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       ( LOADG )                                                       \ enable autoexec for warm start                                  ' autoexec  ' abort >body  #13 cells + !                                                                                      \ and make it permanent for this session                          ' autoexec  ' autoexec >body 3 cells + !                                                                                      \ patch  Autoexec  to load Screen #3020 at startup              \ instead of usual Screen #11                                     #3020 ' autoexec >body 1 cells + !                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            ( LOADG )                                                       \ Ignore xt and b from caller (Screen #3020)                      2DROP                                                                                                                         \ clean dictionary up to EMPTYDEV marker                          emptydev                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      ( LOADG - restore default )                                     \ enable autoexec for warm start                                  ' noop      ' abort >body  #13 cells + !                                                                                      \ and make it permanent for this session                          ' noop      ' autoexec >body 3 cells + !                                                                                      \ restore Autoexec to load                                      \ usual Screen #11                                                #11 ' autoexec >body 1 cells + !                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                           