                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    .( Z80 near structure )   CR                                    ASSEMBLER DEFINITIONS HEX                                       \                                                               \ LIST 250                                                      : NEXT JP (NEXT) AA, ;                                          : PSH1 JP (NEXT) 1 - AA, ;                                      : PSH2 JP (NEXT) 2 - AA, ;                                      \                                                               : HOLDPLACE HERE 0 D, ;                                         : DISP, OVER -                                                    1 - SWAP C! ;                                                 : BACK,                                                          HOLDPLACE SWAP DISP, ;                                         \                                                               -->                                                             ␀                                                               ( Z80 Near struct. )                                            : THEN, HERE DISP, ;                                            : ELSE, JR HOLDPLACE                                              SWAP THEN, ;                                                  FORTH DEFINITIONS                                               DECIMAL ;S  