                    ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ␀                                                               ( Checksum of a RAM chunk )                                     CODE CHECKSUM ( a n -- n2 )                                      POP    DE|                                                      POP    HL|                                                      XORA    A|                                                      INC    D'|                                                     HERE DUP                                                         XORA (HL)|                                                      INCX   HL|                                                      DEC    E'|                                                      JRF   NZ'|  BACK,                                               DEC    D'|                                                      JRF   NZ'|  BACK,                                               LD     E'|  A|                                                  PUSH  DE|                                                       NEXT  C;                                                       \ BURP                                                          \ Example                                                       : BURP                                                          [ HEX ] 7999 6000                                               DO                                                               I HEX . I DECIMAL . CR                                          ?TERMINAL IF QUIT THEN                                         [ HEX ] 100                                                     +LOOP                                                           ;                                                           